@title Place all on a plate too small for every device names "no room", not "too large"
@area Cabinet
# CH-04: the reason came from the last band tried. Fixture: qa/fixtures/make_long_tag_fixture.py (a 450 x 450 plate).
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-small-plate.novo
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text place all
wait 4
key Enter
wait 30
shot place-all-reason
shot place-all-preview
key Enter
wait 20
shot place-all-accepted
expect "Not placed"
expect_not "larger than the usable plate"
check_layout
